sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin
  participant View as Vue (App.vue)
  participant MW as Middleware
  participant C as productController.createProduct
  participant M as Product model (Sequelize)
  participant DB as MySQL

  Admin->>View: Isi form "Tambah produk" lalu klik Simpan
  View->>MW: POST /api/products (JSON + X-CSRF-Token + cookie sesi)
  MW->>MW: csrfProtection: token header == token sesi?
  MW->>MW: requireAuth: session.userId ada & akun aktif?
  MW->>MW: requireRole('admin')
  MW->>MW: validateBody(productSchema): zod + strip tag HTML
  alt Data tidak valid
    MW-->>View: 400 { message, errors[field] }
    View-->>Admin: Pesan error di bawah field terkait
  else Valid
    MW->>C: req.body yang sudah bersih
    C->>M: Product.create({...req.body, warehouse_stock: 0})
    M->>DB: INSERT INTO products (...) VALUES (?, ?, ...)
    DB-->>M: id baru
    C->>M: Product.findByPk(id, include category + supplier)
    M->>DB: SELECT ... LEFT JOIN categories, suppliers
    C-->>View: 201 { product }
    View->>View: loadAll() lalu tampilkan notifikasi sukses
    View-->>Admin: Tabel produk ter-update
  end
